  "contentHtml": "<p>#석회암 #지구계 #지권 #기권 #수권 #상호작용 #탄산칼슘 #지구시스템<br><br>--------------------아래에 설명을 추가해주세요^^</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/79753c7255aae610e512ac070cd55979695a356e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/79753c7255aae610e512ac070cd55979695a356e\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"588\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">석회암 지대에 있었던 사다리가 150여년 만에 이렇게 변한 것으로 추정된다고 합니다.<br>아이들에게 보여주고 어떻게 된건지 맞춰보라고 해도 좋겠습니다.<br><br>석회암은 주로 탄산칼슘이고 종류에따라 탄산마그네슘도 보통 0~10%들어있다고 하네요.<br><a href=\"http://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Contents/Index?contents_id=E0028583\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">http://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Contents/Index?contents_id=E0028583</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"석회암(石灰岩) - 한국민족문화대백과사전\" data-og-description=\"여기를 눌러 링크를 확인하세요\" data-og-host=\"encykorea.aks.ac.kr\" data-og-source-url=\"http://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Contents/Index?contents_id=E0028583\" data-og-url=\"http://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Contents/Index?contents_id=E0028583\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/czQf9t/hyKcEyr0Dj/OrmJxXsMWJ4wcJbGcT9kB1/img.png?width=265&amp;height=40&amp;face=0_0_265_40\"><a href=\"http://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Contents/Index?contents_id=E0028583\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"http://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Contents/Index?contents_id=E0028583\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/czQf9t/hyKcEyr0Dj/OrmJxXsMWJ4wcJbGcT9kB1/img.png?width=265&amp;height=40&amp;face=0_0_265_40)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">석회암(石灰岩) - 한국민족문화대백과사전</p><p class=\"og-desc\">여기를 눌러 링크를 확인하세요</p><p class=\"og-host\">encykorea.aks.ac.kr</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!